# Firefox's sidebar_action (zakius/oganesson#70, dubna's webextensions/README.md): the add-on's
# default_panel is its side panel, as Chromium's side_panel key makes one, without the sidePanel
# permission (src/chrome/common/extensions/api/side_panel/firefox_sidebar_action.cc).
# - side_panel_info.cc: the side panel manifest handler also reads sidebar_action.
# - BUILD.gn, _manifest_features.json: the new file, and the key in Manifest V2 and V3.
# - extension_side_panel_manager.cc: such an add-on gets its side panel entry.
# - extension_context_menu_model.cc: and "Open side panel" in its toolbar menu.
--- a/chrome/browser/extensions/extension_context_menu_model.cc
